      ],
      "source": "https://www.alleganyhistory.org/index.php/places/towns-and-villages/f-j273/independence251/related-articles33/3609-whitesville-175-years",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1920, Whitesville residents subscribed $100,000 to build the Galewhite Milk Condensing Plant, later owned by Borden.",
